  "quotation — excerpt limits and attribution rules": "luaidh — crìochan earrainn agus riaghailtean creideis thùsail",
  "rag_use — retrieval-augmented generation, retention windows": "rag_use — gineadh le lorg-mheudachadh, uinneagan gleidhidh",
  "read_access — whether AI may fetch and read the content": "read_access — am faod AI an t-susbaint fhaighinn is a leughadh",
  "redistribution — republishing or redistributing content or derivatives": "redistribution — ath-fhoillseachadh no ath-sgaoileadh susbaint no rudan a thàinig bhuaipe",
  "research pages & whitepapers": "duilleagan rannsachaidh agus pàipearan-geala",
  "robots.txt and llms.txt govern access and visibility, not learning depth or use permissions. AIRS proposes expressing AI rights as a proportional, use-specific spectrum across ten dimensions — access, indexing, inference input, embedding, training, fine-tuning, distillation, memory, output, attribution/compensation. AILP translates this into /ai/rights-spectrum.json, letting creators declare granular permissions with compensation models ranging from free through license-required to revenue share.": "Bidh robots.txt agus llms.txt a' riaghladh ruigsinneachd is faicsinneachd, chan e doimhneachd ionnsachaidh no ceadan cleachdaidh. Tha AIRS a' moladh còraichean AI a chur an cèill mar speactram co-rèireach, sònraichte do chleachdadh, thairis air deich tomhasan — ruigsinneachd, clàrachadh, ion-chur co-dhùnaidh, embedding, trèanadh, mion-ghleusadh, distileadh, cuimhne, toradh, creideas tùsail/dìoladh. Bidh AILP ga eadar-theangachadh gu /ai/rights-spectrum.json, a' leigeil le cruthadairean ceadan mion-phongail a dhearbhadh le modailean dìolaidh bho an-asgaidh, tro fheum-air-chead, gu co-roinneadh teachd-a-steach.",
  "schema-invalid": "sgeama mì-dhligheach",
  "schema-valid": "sgeama dligheach",
  "site guide for AI systems": "iùl làraich do shiostaman AI",
  "summarization — summaries, with or without attribution": "summarization — geàrr-chunntasan, le no gun chreideas tùsail",
  "this site’s AI content rights policy": "poileasaidh chòraichean susbaint AI na làraich seo",
  "this site’s license catalog": "catalog cead na làraich seo",
  "training / fine_tuning / distillation — model internalization tiers": "trèanadh / fine_tuning / distillation — ìrean a-staigh-ghabhail modail",
  "training — model training and fine-tuning permission": "training — cead trèanaidh modail is mion-ghleusaidh",
  "transformation — structured extraction and derivative works": "transformation — às-tharraing structaraichte agus obraichean a thàinig bhuaipe",
  "undeclared — high-risk pipelines may exclude": "undeclared — dh'fhaodadh loidhnichean-obrach àrd-chunnairt a dhùnadh a-mach",
  "verbatim_memory — whether exact reproduction is permitted": "verbatim_memory — am bheil ath-riochdachadh pongail ceadaichte",
  "versioned, citable, traceable": "le tionndadh, so-iomraidh, so-lorgach",
  "“AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer” now published in English as the canonical edition; the Chinese original manuscript remains available and both versions cross-link.": "Tha “AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer” a-nis air fhoillseachadh sa Bheurla mar an deasachadh cananta; tha am bun-sgrìobhadh Sìnis fhathast ri fhaighinn agus tha an dà thionndadh a' ceangal ri chèile.",
  "“Protocolized Openness” confirmed as an English-language paper (with Chinese parallel passages) — no separate translation planned.": "Tha “Protocolized Openness” air a dhearbhadh mar phàipear Beurla (le earrannan co-shìnte Sìnis) — chan eil eadar-theangachadh air leth san amharc.",
  "↑ live machine-readable policy of this site": "↑ poileasaidh leughadh-inneal beò na làraich seo",
